OPERA=f'''<div class="frame"><header class="opera-header">{brand()}<span class="opera-sign">赤月剧场</span><div class="header-tools"><span>林间的创作空间</span><button class="profile" aria-label="林间的个人资料">林</button></div></header><nav class="opera-nav" aria-label="功能模块">{nav()}</nav><div class="opera-shelf-head"><h2>我的作品<span>六部 · 持续创作中</span></h2><div class="shelf-actions">{search()}<button class="button" data-intent="新建作品">＋ 新建作品</button></div></div><main><section class="opera-stage" aria-label="主作品舞台"><img class="opera-art" src="assets/opera.webp" alt="金饰与丝绒环绕的赤月歌剧舞台"><div class="opera-hero enter"><p class="muted" data-updated>最近编辑 · 今天 14:32</p><h1 class="main-title" data-title>星尘旅人</h1><p class="synopsis">一枚铜星的熄灭，<br>唤醒了一张被遗忘的星图。</p><div class="opera-actions"><button class="button" data-intent="正文">继续写作 <span class="arrow">→</span></button><button class="quiet" data-intent="大纲">故事大纲 ↗</button></div>{stats()}</div><div class="opera-book-stage">{book()}</div><span class="opera-stage-label">林间 · 长篇小说</span><span class="opera-diamond" aria-hidden="true">✧</span><button class="opera-chapter chapter-link enter" data-intent="章节"><small>接续上次的故事</small><div class="chapter-open"><h3>第一章 · 初雪</h3><span class="arrow">↗</span></div><p>穹顶大厅的钟声<br>在雾中回荡了十二下。</p></button><div class="curtain curtain-left" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="curtain curtain-right" aria-hidden="true"></div></section><section class="opera-collection"><div class="opera-collection-head"><h2>未完待续</h2><span>其余五部作品</span><span class="sort">按最近编辑排序 ↓</span></div><div class="opera-books" data-collection>{rows()}</div></section></main><span class="opera-floor-mark" aria-hidden="true">❦</span><div class="opera-footer-note"><span>让每一个故事，都值得登场。</span><span>林间的私人作品集</span></div></div>{controls()}'''

